@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/users

### 1. Criar o primeiro usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Isaque Lucio",
  "username": "isaque.demo",
  "email": "isaque.demo@example.com",
  "password": "Ficticia!Senha-7391",
  "isAdmin": false
}

### 2. Consultar o usuário de id 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 3. Criar o segundo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Marina Costa Ribeiro",
  "username": "marina.costa",
  "email": "marina.costa@example.com",
  "password": "Teste!Marina-4826",
  "isAdmin": false
}

### 4. Criar o terceiro usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Pedro Henrique Alves",
  "username": "pedro.alves",
  "email": "pedro.alves@example.com",
  "password": "Teste!Pedro-6158",
  "isAdmin": false
}

### 5. Criar o quarto usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullname": "Camila Ferreira Santos",
  "username": "camila.santos",
  "email": "camila.santos@example.com",
  "password": "Teste!Camila-9034",
  "isAdmin": false
